   "id": "h01",
   "section": "hook",
   "text": "Meet Max and Lena.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 1.874,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "h02",
   "section": "hook",
   "text": "Same street. Same salary.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 2.294,
   "end": 4.078,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "h03",
   "section": "hook",
   "text": "And on the same Friday, they both open an envelope with a one thousand dollar bonus inside.",
   "refs": [
    "bill"
   ],
   "start": 4.498,
   "end": 10.198,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "h04",
   "section": "hook",
   "text": "A year from now, one of them will barely remember what they spent it on.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 10.618,
   "end": 14.488,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "h05",
   "section": "hook",
   "text": "The other will still be feeling the benefit every single week.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 14.908,
   "end": 18.15,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "h06",
   "section": "hook",
   "text": "Same money. Completely different results.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 18.57,
   "end": 20.965,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "h07",
   "section": "hook",
   "text": "So what did Lena know that Max didn't?",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 21.385,
   "end": 23.634,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m01",
   "section": "meet",
   "text": "Max and Lena are both thirty.",
   "refs": [
    "max30.age"
   ],
   "start": 24.434,
   "end": 26.458,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m02",
   "section": "meet",
   "text": "They both earn sixty thousand dollars a year, and they've lived next door to each other for three years.",
   "refs": [
    "max30.gross_salary",
    "max30.years_next_door"
   ],
   "start": 26.878,
   "end": 32.663,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m03",
   "section": "meet",
   "text": "They borrow each other's ladders, they wave over the fence, and they both work hard.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 33.083,
   "end": 37.53,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m04",
   "section": "meet",
   "text": "Neither of them is bad with money.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 37.95,
   "end": 40.028,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m05",
